OL,3,GNEWSAWales' pre-match haka light show
OL,4,Awas a 'military operation' a year in
OL,5,Athe making
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe light show that wowed crowds ahead
OL,8,Fof Wales' win against New Zealand was a
OL,9,Fyear in the making, according to a
OL,10,FPrincipality Stadium boss.
OL,12,FDuring the All Blacks' pre-match haka
OL,13,Fon Saturday, Wales' players were bathed
OL,14,Fin red light and smoke.
OL,16,FStaring down their opponents, the
OL,17,Fdramatic scene set the tone for their
OL,18,Fdefiant performance and historic
OL,19,Fvictory.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
