OL,3,GNEWSAWales' pre-match haka light show
OL,4,Awas a 'military operation' a year in
OL,5,Athe making
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlex Luff, head of event sales and
OL,8,Foperations at the Principality Stadium,
OL,9,Fsaid the focus of the display was to
OL,10,Frepresent Wales' response to the
OL,11,Fchallenge that New Zealand were going
OL,12,Fto lay down.
